{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows异常主机使用AzCopy或存储资源管理器。对应需求：数据外泄。官方：AzCopy or Azure Storage Explorer Usage on Unusual Host。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows异常主机使用AzCopy或存储资源管理器","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows异常主机使用AzCopy或存储资源管理器\n\n### 为何重要\n把数据带出主机或网络\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/cybersecurity-advisories/aa23-319a","https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-04/aa23-319a-stopransomware-rhysida-ransomware_2.pdf","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/storage/common/storage-use-azcopy-v10","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/storage/storage-explorer/vs-azure-tools-storage-explorer-blobs","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2025/08/27/storm-0501s-evolving-techniques-lead-to-cloud-based-ransomware/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"7265f4fa-4839-4399-924c-a91f1e45d76c","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 数据外泄","来源: 默认","对应需求: 数据外泄"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"host.os.type:windows and event.category:process and event.type:start and\n(\n  (\n    (process.name:\"azcopy.exe\" or process.pe.original_file_name:\"azcopy.exe\") and\n    process.args:(\"copy\" or \"sync\") and\n    process.command_line:(*blob.core.windows.net* or *dfs.core.windows.net* or *file.core.windows.net* or *blob.storage.azure.net*)\n  ) or\n  process.name:(\"StorageExplorer.exe\" or \"StorageExplorer-windows-x64.exe\" or \"StorageExplorer-windows-arm64.exe\" or \"StorageExplorer-windowsx64.exe\")\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1567","name":"Exfiltration Over Web Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1567.002","name":"Exfiltration to Cloud Storage","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0010","name":"Exfiltration","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0010/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1530","name":"Data from Cloud Storage","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1530/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0009","name":"Collection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0009/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.009","name":"Cloud API","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/009/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["host.id"],"history_window_start":"now-7d","interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_field